 "blurb": "Season 4 arena gear for Feral Druid: the Brutal Gladiator's set (Brutal Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm, Brutal Gladiator's Dragonhide Spaulders, Brutal Gladiator's Dragonhide Tunic…), backed by Guardian's offset pieces from the honor vendor. Season 4 has the strictest gates in TBC: the Brutal weapon requires 1950 rating, shoulders 2200, and several pieces check personal rating as well as team rating. The slot-by-slot list below translates what the current arena ladder's top Feral Druids equip into their Season 4 equivalents — same slot logic, this season's items.",
